/td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1968\">\n<td data-start=\"1881\" data-end=\"1892\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exon 14</td>\n<td data-start=\"1892\" data-end=\"1917\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Yes / No</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1917\" data-end=\"1942\">________</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1968\">________</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"2056\">\n<td data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1980\" data-col-size=\"sm\">Exon 18</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"1980\" data-end=\"2005\">Yes / No</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2005\" data-end=\"2030\">________</td>\n<td data-col-size=\"sm\" data-start=\"2030\" data-end=\"2056\">________</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2063\" data-end=\"2086\"><strong data-start=\"2067\" data-end=\"2086\">INTERPRETATION:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2525\">\n<li data-start=\"2088\" data-end=\"2261\">\n<p data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2261\"><strong data-start=\"2090\" data-end=\"2112\">Detected mutation:</strong>_________________________<br data-start=\"2141\" data-end=\"2144\"><br></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2262\" data-end=\"2525\">\n<p data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2292\"><strong data-start=\"2264\" data-end=\"2290\">Clinical Significance:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2525\">\n<li data-start=\"2295\" data-end=\"2361\">\n<p data-start=\"2297\" data-end=\"2361\">Presence of <strong data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2332\">KIT/PDGFRA mutation</strong> confirms diagnosis of GIST</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2364\" data-end=\"2439\">\n<p data-start=\"2366\" data-end=\"2439\">Mutation type may guide therapy (e.g., Imatinib sensitivity/resistance)</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"2442\" data-end=\"2525\">\n<p data-start=\"2444\" data-end=\"2525\">PDGFRA D842V mutation is known to confer <strong data-start=\"2485\" data-end=\"2499\">resistance</strong> to standard TKI therapy</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
